video-tag\">Watch the Vision</div>\n          <div class=\"video-aspect\">\n            <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VMTye70QrFU?si=-sMzo-t2xUH5Enc5\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"hero-video-caption\">\n            <span>Elysium Communities</span>\n            <span class=\"vc-dot\">·</span>\n            <span>Experiential Microcities, Coming 2030</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"hero-sub hero-sub--below-video\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"380\">\n          400 sqft of Mediterranean-inspired design inside a community built for human connection. Reserve your spot before they're gone.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       INTRO CARD — White on dark\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section id=\"what\" class=\"intro-section\">\n    <div class=\"intro-card\">\n      <p class=\"intro-eyebrow\" data-animate=\"fade-up\">The Vision</p>\n      <h2 class=\"intro-h2\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"100\">\n        Traditional Property Isn't<br class=\"br-d\" /> Worth It Anymore.<br />\n        Experiential Real Estate<br class=\"br-d\" /> Is The Future.\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"intro-body\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"200\">\n        Greenhouse breakfast. Lantern lit river. Sauna. Cold plunge. Midnight theatres. Seasonal festivals. A hundred acres of nature. Yours.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"pillars\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"300\">\n        <div class=\"pillar\">\n          <div class=\"pillar-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path d=\"M8 32L20 8L32 32\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              <path d=\"M12 24H28\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>On-Site Agriculture</h3>\n          <p>Farm-to-table food grown steps from your door. Seasonal harvests, morning markets, zero food miles.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pillar-divider\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pillar\">\n          <div class=\"pillar-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <rect x=\"7\" y=\"7\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n              <path d=\"M14 20H26M20 14V26\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Walkable Community</h3>\n          <p>Daily eateries, co-work spaces, and green energy infrastructure — everything you need, all within walking distance.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pillar-divider\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pillar\">\n          <div class=\"pillar-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"13\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              <path d=\"M20 7V13M20 27V33M7 20H13M27 20H33\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Living Credits</h3>\n          <p>Participate in community quests and earn back each month just for showing up and having fun. Living pays dividends here.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ═════════════════════